{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can experience the beginning of <i>and Roger</i>'s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The estimated total playtime is around 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note that save data from the demo cannot be transferred to the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/extras/description_header_en.png?t=1749604335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>and Roger</i></strong> is an interactive novel that lets you see through the protagonist's eyes\u2014whether what she sees makes sense or not. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's just another morning for this young girl. She wakes up and starts getting herself ready while shaking off the sleepiness like always. Except something, somehow, feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/extras/brusing_001.gif?t=1749604335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When she steps into the living room, she expects to find her dad preparing for work. Instead, she finds a stranger sleeping on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/extras/discover_en.gif?t=1749604335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The man wakes up, looks at the girl, and sighs. Ignoring her confusion, he mumbles to himself with a hint of sadness in his voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/extras/text_en.gif?t=1749604335\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/extras/rogerout_en.gif?t=1749604335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scared, the girl runs. She must leave the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/extras/description_footsteps.png?t=1749604335\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/extras/description_road.png?t=1749604335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She doesn't know who this man is or where her father has gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk alongside her on this twisting, twisted path and see where it will lead her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/extras/tictactoe.gif?t=1749604335\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700660?t=1749604335","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/d3aadde7274b4879cb9f5dc05ebf57ff32386ca3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749604335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/a828cf3f49d88b1190f3952858d128818d7269db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749604335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700660/a828cf3f49d88b1190f3952858d128818d7269db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749604335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can experience the beginning of <i>and Roger</i>'s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The estimated total playtime is around 